{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1707","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Replace"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1.5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an integer array $$$a_1,\\ldots, a_n$$$, where $$$1\\le a_i \\le n$$$ for all $$$i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There's a \"replace\" function $$$f$$$ which takes a pair of integers $$$(l, r)$$$, where $$$l \\le r$$$, as input and outputs the pair $$$$$$f\\big( (l, r) \\big)=\\left(\\min\\{a_l,a_{l+1},\\ldots,a_r\\},\\, \\max\\{a_l,a_{l+1},\\ldots,a_r\\}\\right).$$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider repeated calls of this function. That is, from a starting pair $$$(l, r)$$$ we get $$$f\\big((l, r)\\big)$$$, then $$$f\\big(f\\big((l, r)\\big)\\big)$$$, then $$$f\\big(f\\big(f\\big((l, r)\\big)\\big)\\big)$$$, and so on."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now you need to answer $$$q$$$ queries. For the $$$i$$$-th query you have two integers $$$l_i$$$ and $$$r_i$$$ ($$$1\\le l_i\\le r_i\\le n$$$). You must answer the minimum number of times you must apply the \"replace\" function to the pair $$$(l_i,r_i)$$$ to get $$$(1, n)$$$, or report that it is impossible."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two positive integers $$$n$$$, $$$q$$$ ($$$1\\le n,q\\le 10^5$$$) — the length of the sequence $$$a$$$ and the number of the queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ positive integers $$$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n$$$ ($$$1\\le a_i\\le n$$$) — the sequence $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each line of the following $$$q$$$ lines contains two integers $$$l_i$$$, $$$r_i$$$ ($$$1\\le l_i\\le r_i\\le n$$$) — the queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, output the required number of times, or $$$-1$$$ if it is impossible."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 6\n2 5 4 1 3\n4 4\n1 5\n1 4\n3 5\n4 5\n2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n-1\n0\n1\n2\n3\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6 3\n2 3 4 6 1 2\n5 6\n2 5\n2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 3\n3 2 2 4 1\n2 5\n1 3\n1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n-1\n-1\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, $$$n=5$$$ and $$$a=[2,5,4,1,3]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first query: $$$(4,4)\\to(1,1)\\to(2,2)\\to(5,5)\\to(3,3)\\to(4,4)\\to\\ldots$$$, so it's impossible to get $$$(1,5)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second query, you already have $$$(1,5)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the third query: $$$(1,4)\\to(1,5)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the fourth query: $$$(3,5)\\to(1,4)\\to(1,5)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the fifth query: $$$(4,5)\\to(1,3)\\to(2,5)\\to(1,5)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the sixth query: $$$(2,3)\\to(4,5)\\to(1,3)\\to(2,5)\\to(1,5)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1707E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1707/problem/E"}